{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.hinana.first",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "面试室的门被很响地推开",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.hinana.first",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.hinana.first",
    "idolId": "hinana",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "哇～♡今天请多指教～！",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……是，请多指教。那么，先做一下自我介绍……",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "好～♡市川雛菜，高中一年级～～～",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "谢谢。能告诉我你想当偶像的理由吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "嗯～那个呢～听说透先辈要当偶像～……",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "觉得超——好啊～，雛菜也想做啊～所以来了♡",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "原来如此……那接下来，说说你的特长吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "特长～……？嗯～什么都还凑合～！",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "什么都还凑合……？",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "运动啊学习啊，都还挺行的！所以当偶像也很期待～～～♡",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这样啊……那，你印象里的偶像是怎样的？",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "嗯～偶像啊～是开心又幸福～♡ 那种印象？",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "确实，这种印象很强呢。",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不过，偶像不只是开心的事，也有很多辛苦的事哦。",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "诶～辛苦的不要～……",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "啊！雛菜要当『开心担当』！",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "\"开心担当\"……吗。",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "不管什么事都开开心心、幸幸福福地做才是最好的吧～？",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "是啊。作为偶像，我希望粉丝们总是看到笑容。",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "对吧～？雛菜可能很擅长这个哦～～～♡",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "经常有人～说『雛菜看起来好幸福呢～』哦～～～",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈，这样啊。现在也确实很开心，笑得很好呢。",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "啊哈～♡谢谢～～～",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "雛菜啊，不管什么时候呢，都要开开心心～、幸幸福福～地过。",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "……大家也这样就好了呢？",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，能那样的话是最好的了。",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "但也有做不到的人……不，做不到的人更多。",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "所以，让那些人笑起来，才是偶像的工作吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "原来～……那雛菜，很适合当偶像呢？",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "因为看到雛菜幸福～的样子，大家也会变得幸福～吧～？",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊哈哈……是啊。也许正是那样。",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "──……好，谢谢。面试到此结束。",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "诶～～～，雛菜还想多聊一会儿～……",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "没关系，以后说话的机会有很多。",
        "nextNodeId": "35"
      },
      "35": {
        "id": "35",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "作为 283 制作的偶像……请多指教，雛菜。",
        "nextNodeId": "36"
      },
      "36": {
        "id": "36",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "呀哈～♡真的～？好开心～～～！",
        "nextNodeId": "37"
      },
      "37": {
        "id": "37",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，我期待着。",
        "nextNodeId": "38"
      },
      "38": {
        "id": "38",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "我会好好当雛菜的制作人的。",
        "nextNodeId": "39"
      },
      "39": {
        "id": "39",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "嗯！那我就好好被制作～！",
        "nextNodeId": "40"
      },
      "40": {
        "id": "40",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "请多指教哦～～♡雛菜，可能有点喜欢制作人～～～！"
      }
    }
  },
